      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "India has pledged $1.6bn in flood relief for Nepal as Balendra Shah visits Modi, Al Jazeera reports.",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:fa8cf4f0fb5a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "BBC News also reported the story.",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:b470b186840a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "Inflation in India fell to 2.4% in 2025, from 6.7% in 2022.",
      "cites": [
        "wb:FP.CPI.TOTL.ZG:IN"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "India's economy grew 7.6% in 2025, and unemployment stood at 4.2%.",
      "cites": [
        "wb:NY.GDP.MKTP.KD.ZG:IN",
        "wb:SL.UEM.TOTL.ZS:IN"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:36Z",
      "text": "Across South Asia, India's 2.4% inflation compares with a median of 2.7%, while Bangladesh is highest at 8.8%.",
      "cites": [
        "wb:FP.CPI.TOTL.ZG:region:south-asia"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-23T00:00:50Z",
      "text": "India, officially the Republic of India, is a country in South Asia.",
